    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/2474b27b341f7251f04880ccfcadc7fa.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br>&quot;FREQUENCY OF FEAR&quot; is a third-person, episodic psychological horror game that drags you into the disctrict of Halimun, a village that used to be known for it's mysticism, folklore, and secrets. Are you brave enough to find out?  Discover what's still there in Halimun District!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Maya, a newcomer urban explorer on an adventure to uncover hidden truths and starts her journey to become a famous streamer. What begins as material for her expanding channel gradually devolves into a terrifying journey into the unknown. The deeper she explores the eerie alleyways, and creepy houses, the more reality begins to unravel around her. Capture it with Maya and experience the horror that lies beneath Halimun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.poster.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.webm?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.mp4?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Horror Narrative: Follow Maya\u2019s chilling journey across multiple story-driven episodes, each unveiling new layers of the village\u2019s supernatural lore and her own connection to it.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror Troupes: Encounter chilling events, distorted realities, and a persistent sense of dread that creeps in from every corner. Fear comes not only from jump scares!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Urban Exploration: Navigate abandoned, cursed locations rich with atmospheric detail. Use Maya\u2019s camera and flashlight to uncover secrets hidden in the dark, but be careful what you reveal.,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/a20e63bdb91f181adbb1874df57315d8.poster.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/a20e63bdb91f181adbb1874df57315d8.webm?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles &amp; Investigation: Solve environmental puzzles, cryptic symbols, and spiritual locks rooted in local myths. Use Maya's intuition for the only tools for survival.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Soundscape: With chilling sound design and haunting music, whispers, and distant chant becomes a clue (or a warning.)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Thoughts : hint system that feels like the protagonist\u2019s own inner voice and flawlessly integrated into gameplay. Instead of breaking immersion with blunt prompts or pop-ups, it acts as an alternative reminders to help Maya with her goals</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/2474b27b341f7251f04880ccfcadc7fa.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=374 /></span><br>&quot;FREQUENCY OF FEAR&quot; is a third-person, episodic psychological horror game that drags you into the disctrict of Halimun, a village that used to be known for it's mysticism, folklore, and secrets. Are you brave enough to find out?  Discover what's still there in Halimun District!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as Maya, a newcomer urban explorer on an adventure to uncover hidden truths and starts her journey to become a famous streamer. What begins as material for her expanding channel gradually devolves into a terrifying journey into the unknown. The deeper she explores the eerie alleyways, and creepy houses, the more reality begins to unravel around her. Capture it with Maya and experience the horror that lies beneath Halimun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.poster.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.webm?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/9ab4d0650e81d90a9a8b4eb05d64379f.mp4?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodic Horror Narrative: Follow Maya\u2019s chilling journey across multiple story-driven episodes, each unveiling new layers of the village\u2019s supernatural lore and her own connection to it.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological Horror Troupes: Encounter chilling events, distorted realities, and a persistent sense of dread that creeps in from every corner. Fear comes not only from jump scares!,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystical Urban Exploration: Navigate abandoned, cursed locations rich with atmospheric detail. Use Maya\u2019s camera and flashlight to uncover secrets hidden in the dark, but be careful what you reveal.,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/a20e63bdb91f181adbb1874df57315d8.poster.avif?t=1752976164\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183910/extras/a20e63bdb91f181adbb1874df57315d8.webm?t=1752976164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles &amp; Investigation: Solve environmental puzzles, cryptic symbols, and spiritual locks rooted in local myths. Use Maya's intuition for the only tools for survival.,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Soundscape: With chilling sound design and haunting music, whispers, and distant chant becomes a clue (or a warning.)!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Thoughts : hint system that feels like the protagonist\u2019s own inner voice and flawlessly integrated into gameplay. Instead of breaking immersion with blunt prompts or pop-ups, it acts as an alternative reminders to help Maya with her goals</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play as Maya, an aspiring urban explorer, and unravel the truth behind every rumor and myth that haunts every dark corner. Traverse the shadows, survive the horrors, and keep your sanity intact as you uncover the secrets buried within.",
